# The options dialogs of a mission: the menu Esc opens, the game controls,
# and the visual and sound controls behind them.
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 260 228
at 500 key ESC
at 520 shot options_menu
at 521 click 320 200
at 560 shot game_controls
at 561 click 320 244
at 600 shot visual_controls
at 601 key ESC
at 641 click 320 272
at 680 shot sound_controls
at 681 key ESC
at 720 shot game_controls_again
at 721 quit
